Package: reelsee
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: all
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, libadwaita-1-0, libmpv2
Maintainer: Kris Forbes <krisf@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: GTK4/libmpv video player
 Reelsee is a keyboard-first video player built on GTK4, libadwaita and
 vendored libmpv 0.41: GPU-aware engine selection (VAAPI/Vulkan round-robin),
 an overload watchdog with automatic decoder demotion, multi-window with
 focus-audio policy, A/B loops, and async folder playlists.
